{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56326","headline":"山行书情呈王十四 · 武涉","name":"山行书情呈王十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠一径入本来端，艰险千重渡转难。\n涧下厌听流咽水，岩间愁望古松寒。\n风沙终日情迷惑，霜雨侵宵梦不安。\n憔悴途中无镜照，却回蓬鬓似君看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56326.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56326","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}